      "body": "## Summary\n\nOn SM12x the FA4 runtime policy plans SplitKV only for decode (`num_splits=1` for extend). MTP target-verify runs through `forward_extend`, so each full-attention layer ran one CTA per request over the whole context. Verify cost grew linearly with context: 10.4 ms per layer at 428K tokens on an RTX PRO 6000, about 90% of a verify step.\n\n```diff\n forward_extend (final else branch)\n+  verify_split_kv = static-bound decode policy and target_verify and not SWA and not cascade\n+  if verify_split_kv: kwargs[\"max_seqlen_k\"] = self.max_context_len\n   flash_attn_with_kvcache(...,\n-    num_splits=self.num_splits,\n+    num_splits=self.decode_num_splits if verify_split_kv else self.num_splits,\n\n flash_attention_v4.flash_attn_with_kvcache\n+  max_seqlen_k: Optional[int] = None      # was swallowed by **_\n   flash_attn_varlen_func(...,\n+    max_seqlen_k=max_seqlen_k,\n```\n\nThe second change also matters for decode. `flash_attention_v4.flash_attn_with_kvcache` dropped `max_seqlen_k`, so the static bound never reached the planner. Plans fell back to the KV pool size (about 3M tokens here), and most splits were empty.\n\n## Evidence\n\nMiMo-V2.6-Flash NVFP4, TP4 on 4x RTX PRO 6000 Blackwell, EAGLE multi-layer MTP (3 steps, 4 draft tokens), single stream:\n\n| context | before | after |\n|---|---|---|\n| 94K | 99 tok/s | 244 tok/s |\n| 239K | 47 tok/s | 267 tok/s |\n\nNeedle retrieval passes up to 400K with the change. The CUDA-graph replay at long context (graph captured at short context) matches eager output.\n\n## Merge Danger\n\n**Door:** two-way\n\n**Blast Radius:** narrow\n\nOnly `FlashAttentionBackend` on runtimes with `decode_uses_static_max_seqlen_k` (FA4 SM12x) changes, and only for target-verify on non-SWA, non-cascade layers. Other paths pass `max_seqlen_k=None` as before.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #40154190655](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154190655)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #40154190623](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154190623)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #40154190662](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40154190662)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
